WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:06.780
It appeared as though humanity 
would be destroyed by the demons.

2
00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:15.300
But a single mage saved them all.

3
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:27.600
He was called the Wizard King.
and he became a legend.

4
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.110
How'd you like that?
Some lowly commoners just won.

5
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:41.360
How'd you like that. damn it?!

6
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.250
Asta!

7
00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:47.460
Honestly. he's so ridiculous.

8
00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:53.500
You finally awake. you jerk?

9
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.800
So my magic is sealed.

10
00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:00.930
You're going to spill everything 
to the Magic Knights.

11
00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:04.870
including who you guys are 
and what your motives are!

12
00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.180
I refuse.

13
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.390
It appears the end has come.

14
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.080
Ice Magic: Ice Burial.

15
00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:22.620
Talk about resolve.

16
00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.290
You idiot!

17
00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.000
What do...

18
00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.000
What do you think life is?!

19
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.660
What Happened on a Certain 
Day in the Castle Town

20
00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:04.900
Grey words can't make anything happen

21
00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.540
I know. yeah I know

22
00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:12.820
Wishing to fly freely across the sky

23
00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.790
I dreamed it all my life

24
00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:18.560
Step by step I go. though 
it's a doubtful world 

25
00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.710
Don't care how much I fall

26
00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:24.200
Instinct is my guide. I never give up

27
00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:30.440
To faraway future. I burst out running

28
00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:35.610
Go beyond even the unseen fears

29
00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:40.990
The vision I had. so I can be myself

30
00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:46.240
Someday I will write the next page

31
00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.750
You are my hope

32
00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.500
Like that page from someday

33
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.830
I was able to meet you

34
00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.800
I call this a miracle

35
00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:10.640
Sounds like you guys went through hell!

36
00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.750
Why does he sound so happy about that?

37
00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.180
Someone even died.

38
00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:21.150
Hey. Captain. I don't think 
this is a laughing matter.

39
00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:25.740
Being depressed isn't going to 
bring Old Man Seihi back. Right?

40
00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.410
Yes. sir! It's just as you say. sir.

41
00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:32.130
Old Man Seihi liked to see 
everyone happy and energetic.

42
00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.430
Come on. You guys should be laughing. too.

43
00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.170
Come on!

44
00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.040
Louder!

45
00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:44.810
You. too. Lady Noe!

46
00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.390
That's how it should be.

47
00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.270
What happened to
Old Man Seihi really is a shame.

48
00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.130
but you three were able 
to protect the villagers.

49
00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.440
Be proud of that.

50
00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:11.450
Well done. Great job. you idiots.

51
00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.850
Yes. sir!

52
00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.620
Thanks.

53
00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.370
What's that?

54
00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:23.470
You moron! You don't even know 
the Magic Knights' salute?!

55
00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.760
Take a good look!

56
00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:28.510
These fingers symbolize the clover.

57
00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:29.930
Go on. give it a try.

58
00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:31.320
Yes. sir!

59
00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.100
Well done!

60
00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.850
We're back.

61
00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:42.360
Great job. you three.

62
00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.420
Miss Vanessa! Finral!

63
00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.610
Captain. we went to the
Magic Investigation Department.

64
00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.280
Good. Did you find anything out?

65
00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.550
Who the heck's behind all this?!

66
00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.590
I'll find their hideout and raid it!

67
00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.600
I'll beat the crap out of 
the guy who got away. too!

68
00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.080
Well. you see.

69
00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:05.590
they investigated the item he left behind.

70
00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.760
but still don't have a clue.

71
00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.090
How useless can they be?

72
00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.680
You fools!

73
00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.290
Stop breaking stuff!

74
00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:21.150
Sorry!

75
00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:26.560
But that pocket watch is pretty nice.

76
00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:31.510
Yes. and from what you said 
about how they were acting.

77
00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.780
they were all of very high status.

78
00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.810
So they're royalty or nobles.

79
00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:42.200
Oh. who's this little guy? He's adorable.

80
00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.920
How's it adorable?!

81
00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.640
I-It is adorable!

82
00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.660
Ow. ow. ow. ow. ow!

83
00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.710
Why. you little!

84
00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.520
Hey. come here.

85
00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.680
You ugly little bird! 
I'll turn you into fried chicken!

86
00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.310
I won't let you turn him into fried chicken!

87
00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.840
Say your prayers!

88
00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.230
Don't you dare!

89
00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.510
Are you two trying to break the building?!

90
00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:10.570
We're sorry!

91
00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.820
You're the one breaking everything. though.

92
00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.790
All right. listen up.

93
00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:22.430
It doesn't matter if the ones behind 
this are royalty or nobility.

94
00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.450
We're going to let the 
Investigation Department

95
00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.580
take care of this. 
and we'll wait for their report.

96
00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.840
More importantly. I've got some good news.

97
00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.110
Good news?

98
00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.340
Wanna hear it?

99
00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:34.180
Of course!

100
00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:40.890
Your actions have been acknowledged 
by the Wizard King himself!

101
00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:41.890
The Wizard King?!

102
00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.400
You've been given a star!

103
00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:48.440
Whoa. seriously?!

104
00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.590
All right!

105
00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.920
Yeah!

106
00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.030
Wow.

107
00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:55.910
Heck yeah!

108
00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.410
Congrats.

109
00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.240
So. what are stars?

110
00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.730
Don't get so excited if you 
don't know what they are!

111
00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:04.580
Stars are awarded by the Wizard 
King based on our performance.

112
00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.750
What are they good for?

113
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.720
Well... They're like an honor.

114
00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.000
Honor?!

115
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.530
That's right. Asta! Honor!

116
00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.550
It's a badge of honor for a man!

117
00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.120
There's a lady here. too.

118
00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.350
It's a badge of honor for a man and a woman!

119
00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.980
That makes no sense.

120
00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:24.980
The various Magic Knights squads
 compete to get the most stars.

121
00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:30.080
The number of stars indicates 
how much work a squad has done.

122
00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.490
I see!

123
00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:37.690
Speaking of. the Golden Dawn is currently 
at the top with seventy stars.

124
00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.370
Seventy?!

125
00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.970
What about us? How many 
do the Black Bulls have?

126
00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.330
We can't lose to the Golden Dawn!

127
00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.340
We...

128
00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.140
finally have a nice. even negative thirty.

129
00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.330
Negative?!

130
00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.470
What?

131
00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.010
We're finally only a hundred 
away from the Golden Dawn.

132
00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.250
A hundred?!

133
00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:13.380
It's going to take forever to catch 
up and beat them! Damn it. Yuno!

134
00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.990
Not happening.

135
00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:20.200
Should I really be in this squad?

136
00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.290
One other thing.

137
00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.920
Here's your pay for this month.

138
00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.340
Huh?

139
00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.090
It's money! There's at 
least 200.000 yuls here!

140
00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.880
Thanks!

141
00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:40.680
Thanks. Captain! I'm going to eat 
lots of yummy things with this!

142
00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.660
Yeah. eat up.

143
00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.590
Hey. Captain! How much would 
it take for you to fight me?

144
00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:47.920
Well? Well?

145
00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.090
I won't.

146
00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.690
Aw. come on!

147
00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:56.120
I was thinking about buying new clothes 
for my goddess. my little sister. Marie.

148
00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.070
What do you think will look best on her?

149
00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.320
Don't ask me.

150
00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:01.740
No idea.

151
00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:06.160
Tomorrow's gonna be a day off. 
so don't let it go to waste.

152
00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.050
I'm gonna go on tons of dates!

153
00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:10.350
Do whatever you want.

154
00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:14.160
Thanks!

155
00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:16.360
Thank you for everything. Captain.

156
00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:22.100
We should all go out somewhere and 
have fun. What do you guys think?

157
00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:23.960
This isn't much.

158
00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.640
You moron!

159
00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.950
You could buy at least ten years' 
worth of tatoes with this money!

160
00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.860
Tatoes? What are those?

161
00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:35.860
Potatoes from Hage Village that taste 
bland and have a questionable texture.

162
00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.150
That sounds awful.

163
00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:42.050
They aren't! Sister Lily can 
make anything taste good!

164
00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:42.990
And who's that?

165
00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:46.450
The woman I'm going to marry someday!

166
00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:47.750
What?

167
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:51.870
But aren't sisters women of the cloth? 
I don't think they can get married.

168
00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:56.130
I-It'll work out somehow! 
I'll go beyond all limitations!

169
00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.590
Are you stupid?

170
00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:00.370
Congrats on your first payday!

171
00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.570
What do you plan to do with it?

172
00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.390
I haven't decided.

173
00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.210
What about you. little boy?

174
00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:10.390
I-I'm going to send some money 
back to the church in Hage.

175
00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:14.110
That's a great idea. Asta! 
That's the manly thing to do!

176
00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:17.970
Right?! Do you send money back. too?

177
00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.630
Of course I do! But...

178
00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.030
But?

179
00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:24.620
Only after I've increased it a hundredfold!

180
00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.870
You never learn. do you?

181
00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.960
A man's gotta take risks!

182
00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:32.930
By "man." you must mean "moron."

183
00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:36.270
Sending some money back is 
fine. but don't send it all.

184
00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.650
Use a little bit for yourself.

185
00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.470
Sh-Should I?

186
00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.590
But what should I use it for?

187
00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:47.490
Let's go shopping in the 
castle town tomorrow.

188
00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:48.720
You. too.

189
00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:49.890
Shopping?

190
00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:52.190
I'll take you both.

191
00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.830
Sister Lily. how are you doing?

192
00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:05.810
I'm doing well.

193
00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:09.290
All of the kind senior squad members 
are taking good care of me.

194
00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:12.080
Asta. stand right here.

195
00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.680
What are we doing?

196
00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.580
Don't move.

197
00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.000
Flame Magic:

198
00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.340
Exploding...

199
00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:28.890
Fireball!

200
00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:32.670
Hot! Hot. hot. hot. hot!

201
00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.600
I told you not to move!

202
00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:36.270
I didn't!

203
00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:41.200
Also. I did really well on my first mission.

204
00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.560
and received a star from the Wizard King 
for my excellent performance.

205
00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:51.300
At this rate. I might be able to 
become the Wizard King by next month.

206
00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:56.660
I want to become the Wizard King and make 
this a world where everyone can be happy.

207
00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:00.710
Then I'll come for you. so please marry me.

208
00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:05.890
"Oh. I just had my first payday. 
so I'm sending you the money."

209
00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.880
I'm done!

210
00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.430
This is an awesome letter. 
if I do say so myself.

211
00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.950
I wonder if Sister Lily 
will be moved to tears.

212
00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.730
The Wizard King...

213
00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.270
The Wizard King. huh?

214
00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.940
I wonder what he's like...

215
00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.220
Have you ever been to the castle town?

216
00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.510
I haven't.

217
00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:44.050
I guess royals and nobles wouldn't 
really have reason to go very often.

218
00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.270
How about you. little boy?

219
00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:49.420
I just passed through when I went to 
take the Magic Knights Entrance Exam.

220
00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:52.390
Then let's have a lot of fun today.

221
00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:55.010
Hey. stop touching me.

222
00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:57.870
I can't help it! Do you want me to fall?

223
00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:02.570
I can't stop thinking about 
him for some reason. Ugh...

224
00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.040
Again?!

225
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:14.290
The Clover Kingdom is split between the 
Noble Realm. where royalty and nobility live.

226
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Saussy

227
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Spade Kingdom

228
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Forsaken Realm

229
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Rayaka

230
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Heart
 Kingdom

231
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Common Realm

232
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Noble Realm

233
00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:19.830
Diamond
 Kingdom

234
00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:16.990
the Common Realm. where the commoners live.

235
00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:19.830
and the Forsaken Realm. 
where the peasants live.

236
00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:23.920
The Castle Town of Kikka. 
where Asta and Yuno took

237
00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:27.340
the Magic Knights Entrance Exam. 
is in the Common Realm.

238
00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.630
It's still amazing!

239
00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:37.080
It's very lively.

240
00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:49.680
I hope I can bring Sister Lily and the 
kids from the church here someday.

241
00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:52.070
What about me?!

242
00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:53.720
Oh?

243
00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:01.280
Marie. my goddess. I'll be there soon.

244
00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:06.420
I want to see your smiling face as soon 
as possible. I can't contain myself.

245
00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.370
Mister!

246
00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.560
That voice...

247
00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:24.700
So you've come again.

248
00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:26.480
I have.

249
00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:28.950
I'm not going to lose this month!

250
00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:30.410
I won't. either!

251
00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.430
The ultra ultimate super 
large serving of everything!

252
00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:36.830
I dare you to eat all of it!

253
00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.080
Thanks for the nummies!

254
00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:44.760
Munchy. munchy. munchy. munchy. munchy...

255
00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.090
I'm getting heartburn just watching her.

256
00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:53.910
Do you have some time. miss?

257
00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.680
Want to have some tea with me?

258
00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.100
Do I look like I have time?

259
00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:02.020
You can bring your kids along. 
I know a great place—

260
00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.950
You actually think they're my kids?!

261
00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.730
They're my brother and sister!

262
00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.190
I have to hurry home so we can open the shop.

263
00:15:08.190 --> 00:15:10.080
I don't have any time to mess around.

264
00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.750
Man. I love tough young ladies.

265
00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:20.040
Miss. want to have some fun with me?

266
00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:24.820
Don't get too far ahead. little boy.

267
00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.250
I'm so excited!

268
00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.250
Don't you two want to buy anything?

269
00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:33.010
There are just so many things. 
I don't know what to get.

270
00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.890
I don't really...

271
00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.680
Hey. those robes... They're Magic Knights.

272
00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:45.260
That mark... Ugh. it's the Black Bulls!

273
00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.570
That's the lush witch Vanessa.

274
00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:52.390
Are the cute girl next to her and 
the little kid also Black Bulls?

275
00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.240
It's probably best to stay away.

276
00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:57.840
They're starting to get a bit restless.

277
00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:03.370
It's fine. Magic Knights being 
in town helps deter crime.

278
00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:07.200
Not to mention. some fine 
gentlemen might approach us.

279
00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.550
I've bought some healing herbs.

280
00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:17.420
as well as some shique ointment. 
which acts as a poison antidote.

281
00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.890
That should do it.

282
00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:25.830
I bought what I needed. so why don't 
we go somewhere a bit more quiet?

283
00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.100
Somewhere quiet?

284
00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.840
I know just the place.

285
00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.180
This way.

286
00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.560
That way?

287
00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:36.450
Isn't this just some alley?

288
00:16:42.510 --> 00:16:44.000
It's a dead end.

289
00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.190
Huh?!

290
00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.730
Come now.

291
00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.850
Whoa!

292
00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:05.290
Black Market

293
00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:02.970
This is the Black Market.

294
00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:04.830
The Black Market?

295
00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:13.400
It's a bit dangerous. but they have 
some very effective magical items.

296
00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:17.210
Hey. Vanessa. I got some good stuff in.

297
00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.700
Hey! I'll take a look later.

298
00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:22.330
Awesome!

299
00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.760
Oh. you don't seem too excited.

300
00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.940
Well. no.

301
00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.760
I guess I can't blame you.

302
00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:32.340
Royals and nobles won't set foot 
in here because of their prejudices.

303
00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:38.510
But you can't control your 
magical powers yet. right?

304
00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.330
Th-That's right. Why?

305
00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.350
They have items that can help you 
control your magical powers here.

306
00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:51.110
If you can find an item that's a good
 fit for you. and adjust your powers.

307
00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:53.730
you might be able to control them.

308
00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:56.110
Control my powers...

309
00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.860
Why don't we take a look around?

310
00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.990
S-Sure.

311
00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.430
It's really lively over there.

312
00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.870
You two are a bit too 
young to go in there yet.

313
00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.540
Amateurs shouldn't spend too much time 
in there. or it could ruin their lives.

314
00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.460
All right!

315
00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:15.960
Let's do this! Let's do this!

316
00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.880
I'm going to make my paycheck
 grow a hundredfold!

317
00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:21.360
Hey. I know that guy!

318
00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.600
Damn it. I lost again! Bah-ha...

319
00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.600
I can see the future.

320
00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:35.610
Bah-ha! That old lady's strong.

321
00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:41.660
I really shouldn't be wasting time 
here. anyway. I have work to do.

322
00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:46.560
Well. the job's to catch a purse-snatcher.

323
00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:49.630
Is that even a job for a Magic Knight?

324
00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:51.670
Bah-ha...

325
00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:56.590
But the captain would get 
real scary if I refused.

326
00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:02.430
You got a problem with that?
I'll slice you in two!

327
00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:08.260
Bah-ha! I finally managed 
to join the Magic Knights.

328
00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.130
but it's the Green Praying Mantises.

329
00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:15.020
I'm a praying mantis. A frickin' bug.

330
00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:18.260
All I do every day is run errands.

331
00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:21.690
When I finally got an actual mission. 
I got used as bait and almost died.

332
00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:24.490
I'm constipated and my hair's thinning.

333
00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:26.680
Bah-ha. damn it.

334
00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:30.450
Hey. she's cute!

335
00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:35.500
What about this? You could probably 
use this to stabilize your powers.

336
00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.600
It looks so cheesy.

337
00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.920
Well. just give it a try.

338
00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.210
Bah-ha?!

339
00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.480
You shouldn't have been walking there!

340
00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:02.990
Bah-ha! Well. well.
 what brings you two down here?

341
00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:09.560
The Black Market is no place 
for you lovely ladies. Bah-ha!

342
00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.440
Did you get lost?

343
00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:16.290
As an elite member of the Magic Knights. 
I shall guide you out of here.

344
00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:18.510
Get lost. you insect.

345
00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.000
Bah-ha...

346
00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:25.300
Hey! I found something really cool!

347
00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.010
You didn't actually buy that. did you?

348
00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.630
It talks!

349
00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:30.810
So you did.

350
00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:31.700
Look!

351
00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.570
We are hoomans.

352
00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:34.390
See?

353
00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.980
What. exactly?

354
00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.740
Bah-ha!

355
00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.590
Th-That's...

356
00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.560
Huh? Hey. you're Bah-ha!

357
00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.500
It's Sekke! Bah-ha!

358
00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.370
How've you been. Bah-ha?

359
00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:50.530
The name's Bah-ha! No. wait. Sekke!

360
00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:52.310
Who's that?

361
00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.870
I took the Entrance Exam with him.

362
00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.790
Ah. you're a member of the 
Green Praying Mantises.

363
00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:02.740
He's with two beautiful girls?! Wait. no...

364
00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.680
They're both members of 
the Black Bulls. too.

365
00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:10.480
Asta. you bastard! 
You're making me jealous.

366
00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:16.970
Besides. it's all your fault that 
I ended up in the Green Praying Mantises.

367
00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:20.810
Bah-ha! You infuriating bah-hastard!

368
00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.330
Th-Thief!

369
00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:37.080
My winnings! Stop!

370
00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:55.120
No one can escape from here

371
00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:01.640
Once again in the small closed off classroom

372
00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:09.740
The star of the class was shining yet again

373
00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:16.750
They shine so bright that I close my eyes

374
00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:19.620
I've thought many times

375
00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:23.290
That the revolution was within my hands

376
00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:31.010
Isn't it strange? If you want 
to laugh. go ahead and laugh

377
00:22:31.010 --> 00:22:37.770
The rest of us who were left 
behind wanted to become something

378
00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:45.020
We repeat the same morning over and over

379
00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:51.910
You're the only one who 
can choose your tomorrow

380
00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:56.800
Let's go beyond our current selves

381
00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:15.430
Petit Clover

382
00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:14.450
Petit Clover!

383
00:23:14.930 --> 00:23:18.930
Sekke's Bah-Ha Seminar

384
00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:18.320
Sekke's Bah-Ha Seminar!

385
00:23:19.270 --> 00:23:20.430
Bah-ha!

386
00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:22.190
Bah-ha.

387
00:23:21.070 --> 00:23:22.680
Wrong! It's...

388
00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:23.940
Bah-ha!

389
00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:25.780
Bah-ha!

390
00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:29.440
Asta. you have yet to learn 
the ways of the bah-ha.

391
00:23:29.440 --> 00:23:30.940
Bah-ha!

392
00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:32.730
The ways of the bah-ha?!

393
00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:38.290
Bah-ha! This is my chance 
to make a name for myself!

394
00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:42.320
I'm going to catch the thief and 
get praise from the Wizard King. ha!

395
00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:46.360
Black Clover. Page 12:
"The Wizard King Saw."

396
00:23:43.620 --> 00:23:51.140
Page 10
The Wizard King Saw

397
00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:49.840
Not giving up is my bah-ha!
